    <title>Homemade sausage and egg mcmuffin</title>
    <updated>2026-07-31T16:55:12.872060+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Homemade sausage and egg mcmuffin&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/homemade-sausage-and-egg-mcmuffin.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;Copycat of McDonald's Sausage and Egg McMuffin. The sausage patties are made from scratch and it really does taste similar to the McDonald's Sausage patty - but it tastes pure, like real food should! Great make ahead breakfast - grab and run!&lt;/p&gt;</content>
